    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's exactly it though. there isn't a third option. i try to think about \"starting over\" or \"finding myself\" but it's pathetic. how do you rebuild when the foundation is just... ash? it feels like the universe is telling me the story is done. like there's no point in even trying to fix what's clearly broken beyond repair.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
